  "title": "Delicious Christmas Cookies",
  "description": "This family recipe combines graham cracker crumbs, flour, sweetened condensed milk, butter, coconut and candy-coated chocolates. They just might become a tradition in your family too!",
  "authors": [
    "Lynn Newton"
  ],
